  "body": "Embrace the rhythm of marina living at 47 Waterside Crescent, a beautifully presented first-floor apartment perfectly positioned in the heart of Gulf Harbour.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, the sweeping marina views set the scene. Open the floor to ceiling glass doors to the spacious, sunny balcony and enjoy your morning coffee, an afternoon glass of wine or simply soak up the sunshine while watching life on the water.\r\n\r\nInside, the generous, Mediterranean-inspired tiled open-plan living and dining with a modern kitchen create an inviting hub for everyday living and entertaining. Featuring three bedrooms and two bathrooms, including a master suite, the separate laundry and ample storage add practicality to the picture.\r\n\r\nYour cars are well catered for too, with a secure internal access double garage and additional storage conveniently positioned downstairs.  Safe and secure entry (apartment has both stairs and lift access) offers peace of mind, and private access to the waterside is exclusive to owners here at \"The Lookouts\".\r\n\r\nThe lifestyle is hard to beat. Step out into the heart of Gulf Harbour Marina, with restaurants, cafes, shops and amenities all close at hand. If boating is your passion, berths are available to rent, making it easy to truly embrace the coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nViews, sunshine, space and marina living - this is your opportunity to secure your own slice of the Mediterranean in Gulf Harbour.\r\n\r\n\r\nCall for a viewing anytime.",
